{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/steamHeaders_Development.png?t=1740868022\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/Steam_Exploration.gif?t=1740868022\" />Play at your own pace, explore freely while enjoying small details of Mediterranean nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse land, sea and sky, and collect the memories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENJOY THE MOMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/Steam_Enjoy.gif?t=1740868022\" />Feel the hot summer day, breathe in fresh smell of the pine trees, jump into crystal clear sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Notice the small details around you and learn to just live in the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET THE SPIRIT OF THE WILDERNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spirits inspired by old Croatian folk tales are all around you, can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about them and unravel their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/Steam_Movement.gif?t=1740868022\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the tale about growing up and overcoming the challenges of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn Croatian and Mediterranean legends first-hand from the creatures that inhabit them and discover lost cultural monuments and traditions.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2006540?t=1740868022